//PLATE MAIL +1 - 4000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/PLAT10.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Plate Mail"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Plate mail is a combination of chain armor with metal plates covering the vital areas such as the chest, abdomen, and groin. Similar in construction to bronze plate mail, true plate mail comprises chain and leather.

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 3 (0 vs. slashing, 2 vs. piercing and missile)
Speed Factor: -3
Requires:
 13 Strength

Weight: 50"

	SAY NAME2 "Plate Mail +1"
	SAY DESC "Plate mail is a combination of chain armor with metal plates covering the vital areas such as the chest, abdomen and groin. Similar in construction to bronze plate mail, true plate mail comprises chain and leather. 
	In addition, this suit of plate mail is enchanted and gives additional bonuses to the wearer's Armor Class.

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 2 (-1 vs. slashing, 1 vs. piercing and missile)
Speed Factor: -3
Requires:
 13 Strength

Weight: 40
"




